  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: Very nice - with the Speed Grow on those seeds, you'll be harvesting in no time. It'll slightly lower the quality of the product, but that's fine for now - your first customer won't be picky.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Speaking of such, <h1>Kevin</h> will be the first guy you'll be sellin' to. He's my ex wife's nephew's cousin's friend or something like that. He ain't the brightest fella around, but he's a friendly guy.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: I've passed your number onto him, you should get a message from him later today. That'll be your chance to pick up your first contract. Talk to ya later.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
